==Description==
'''Hardcore Intermission Lobby''' is the main hub for [[Hardcore Mode|Hardcore]] mode matches. It contains four panels with a random map in them, an inventory area that allows the player to access the inventory, though with some sections like crates disabled and a super computer that allows the player to override the current maps if they are a VIP.

On top of the interactable spots on the map, there are three buttons on the screen. These are veto, which if the specified number of players votes for overrides every currently selected map, ready, which instantly starts the match and inventory, which opens the inventory.

Entering the '''Hardcore Intermission Lobby''' through private servers gives the player access to unlimited map overrides without VIP, allows them to play on community maps and gives them unlimited vetos. However, it also adds in a 25 second timer whenever a map is overridden or all maps are vetoed.

==Appearance==
The '''Hardcore Intermission Lobby''' is a small island made entirely out of stone. There are a few purple thorns and neon purple crystals around the map. The island is surrounded by pink water and multiple grey rocks.

There is a small armory which contains a corrupted statue and multiple chests with various tower and consumable weaponry. Four panels can be seen which display a map and their difficulty. Next to these panels, there is a super computer which has a statue next to it that holds a VIP tag. The last notable object on this map is the [[Leaderboard]]s, which display triumphs in [[Hardcore Mode|Hardcore]] mode in the current day and month.

